  "pages": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "layout": "illustration-top",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "A tiny star shining brighter than all the others in a beautiful night sky",
        "animation": "fade-in",
        "animationDuration": "2s",
        "url": "/demo/images/page1.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "Once upon a time, in a sky full of stars, there was one little star who shone just a bit brighter than the rest.",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "words-fade-in",
        "animationDelay": "1s"
      },
      "music": "wonder",
      "timing": {
        "autoPause": "3s",
        "readingSpeed": "slow"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "layout": "illustration-full",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "The little star looking down at a peaceful village",
        "animation": "slide-up",
        "animationDuration": "1.5s",
        "url": "/demo/images/page2.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "Every night, she watched the world below. She saw children sleeping, parents reading stories, and cats prowling on rooftops.",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "music": "wonder",
      "timing": {
        "autoPause": "3s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "layout": "illustration-top",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "The little star among bigger, sleepy stars",
        "animation": "fade-in",
        "url": "/demo/images/page3.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "\"Why do I shine so bright?\" she wondered. The bigger stars just yawned. \"Stars shine. That's what we do. Don't overthink it.\"",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "words-fade-in"
      },
      "music": "wonder",
      "timing": {
        "autoPause": "4s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "layout": "illustration-full",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "The star flying bravely through colorful clouds",
        "animation": "zoom-in",
        "animationDuration": "2s",
        "url": "/demo/images/page4.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "But the little star wasn't satisfied. One night, she took a deep breath and flew \u2014 right through the clouds, past the moon, toward the world below.",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "typewriter"
      },
      "music": {
        "crossfade": "adventure",
        "duration": "2s"
      },
      "timing": {
        "autoPause": "3s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "layout": "illustration-top",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "The star lighting up a child's bedroom window",
        "animation": "fade-in",
        "animationDuration": "2s",
        "url": "/demo/images/page5.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "She found a child who was afraid of the dark. The little star pressed herself against the window and glowed with all her might.",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "words-fade-in"
      },
      "music": "adventure",
      "timing": {
        "autoPause": "4s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "layout": "illustration-top",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "The child smiling at the star's warm light",
        "animation": "fade-in",
        "url": "/demo/images/page6.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "The child smiled, pulled the blanket up, and whispered, \"Thank you, little star.\" And for the first time, the star knew exactly why she shone so bright.",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "words-fade-in",
        "animationDelay": "0.5s"
      },
      "music": {
        "crossfade": "peaceful",
        "duration": "3s"
      },
      "timing": {
        "autoPause": "5s",
        "readingSpeed": "slow"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "layout": "illustration-full",
      "illustration": {
        "source": "file",
        "alt": "All the stars shining brighter together",
        "animation": "fade-in",
        "animationDuration": "3s",
        "url": "/demo/images/page7.jpg"
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "She flew back to the sky, and something magical happened \u2014 all the other stars began to shine a little brighter too. Because sometimes, all it takes is one brave little star to light up the whole sky.",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "wordHighlight": true,
        "animation": "words-fade-in",
